        "turn": 165,
        "summary": "I have begun the turn by ensuring research is set to Printing (though I am already researching it, I confirmed the status). I have also verified the production in Preah Vihear, where an Amphitheater is currently being built. \n\nSince I am in a Golden Age and have a strong religious presence with many Missionaries and Gurus, I will focus on spreading Buddhism and managing my growing empire. I have no immediate unit moves to make this turn as most are stationed or in optimal positions for religious spread.\n\n**Turn Summary:**\n- Researching: Printing\n- City Production: Preah Vihear is building an Amphitheater (3 turns remaining).\n- No unit movements or new settlements this turn.",
        "actions": [
