        "summary": "I am playing as the Khmer. I have 8 cities and a strong religious presence with several Missionaries and Gurus. I am currently researching Ballistics to improve my military capabilities.\n\nOn this turn:\n- Set research to **Ballistics**.\n- Set production in **Angkor Thom** to a **Workshop** (4 turns).\n- Set production in **Kompong Svay** to a **Library** (6 turns) to bolster science in a slower-growing city.\n- I'll leave my military and religious units in place for now, monitoring the borders and religious spread.\n\nSummary: Researched Ballistics, updated production in Angkor Thom and Kompong Svay.",
